          "description": "\"Wild and Free\" is a hopeful cinematic duet that captures the spirit of living life to the fullest. It showcases the unique sibling vocals of \"The Blood Harmonies\" with a lilting intricate melody and complex harmony. It is written from the perspective of parents to a child to encourage them to embrace their individuality, enjoy the world around them, and reinforces the idea that they are worth the time and effort it takes to raise them. All inquiries contact Meg Anzalone [REDACTED]",
